        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>BAL-COL-TRR, Baldwin Columbus Entry Set with Traditional Round Rose Interior Trim</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Columbus Handleset features oval mounts on the outside and traditional round mounts on the inside. Choose from 6 interior trim options and lots of beautiful finishes. This entry set made by Baldwin is designed to fit standard 2-1/8 inch predrilled doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Columbus Handleset fits door thicknesses of 1-3/4 inches all the way up to 2-1/2 inches. A grade 2 entranceset, it has a lifetime manufacturer's mechanical warranty. Select from single, double, or dummy cylinder functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Columbus Traditional Handleset with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Columbus Traditional Oval Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Length: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length (without deadbolt): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length center to center (without deadbolt): 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-8/9\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Columbus Handleset with Round Interior Trim, Baldwin COL-TRR",
                "description": "Baldwin COL-TRR, Columbus Handleset - The Columbus Handleset features oval mounts on the outside and traditional round mounts on the inside. Choose from 6 interior trim options and 6 beautiful finishes. This entry set made by Baldwin is designed to fit standard 2-1/8 inch predrilled doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Columbus Handleset fits door thicknesses of 1-3/4 inches all the way up to 2-1/2 inches. A grade 2 entranceset, it has a lifetime manufacturer's mechanical warranty. Select from single, double, or dummy cylinder functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Baldwin Columbus Entry Set with Traditional Round Rose Interior Trims, BAL-COL-TRR, Oval Columbus Front Door Handlesets, Baldwin Columbus Handlesets, Columbus Traditional Handleset with Round Roses, Baldwin Columbus Traditional Oval Entrysets, oval handlesets,"
